{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から2013年乃木坂の活動start!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もバンバンいくぞー★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ happy birthday★★\n今日で二十歳??!\nみさみさはsexy"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\nとっくに二十歳になっているもんだと......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくおめでとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は明日のリハ前に\nお友だちとお昼食べてきたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は韓国料理でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいから食べ過ぎちゃった；\nちょっと苦しー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう4日だしどこのお店も\n空いてるんだろうと思っていたけど、\nまだまだ人いっぱいでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々みんなに会えて楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は新年始めの握手会。\n皆さんに会えるの楽しみにしてるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いし行こうか迷ってるーて方\n明日絶対行くぜぃって方\n今Blog読んでくれてるあ・な・た"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんと一緒にルンルンして\n待ってるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/04/1079788/0008.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}